cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the model weights, please cite it as below."
title: "ColFOV: Semantic-guided field-of-view adaptation for colonoscopy AI"
abstract: >-
  ColFOV segments colonoscopy frames into four classes (background or recorder
  interface, tissue field, optical corner, picture-in-picture) and combines the
  predictions of 24 evenly spaced frames that share one capture layout into stable
  full-FOV and inner-FOV bounding boxes, with an optional, causal session-level
  picture-in-picture box. The network outputs only the segmentation mask; all
  bounding boxes are derived geometry and are withheld, with a stated reason, when
  their evidence conditions are not met.
